default_branch":"main","stargazers":0,"master_branch":"main"},"pusher":{"name":"jobfynder-admin","email":"jobfynder.com@gmail.com"},"forced":false,"sender":{"login":"jobfynder-admin","id":213675935,"node_id":"U_kgDODLxvnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/213675935?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin","html_url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jobfynder-admin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created":true,"deleted":false,"base_ref":null,"compare":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/compare/1d600745719a^...a2fe31cdb1df","commits":[{"id":"1d600745719a94eb832116af3630da3cfcaabd19","tree_id":"88fd56ba6151fd50d0b744fe70ec9fddb07c12a1","distinct":true,"message":"feat(resume): role profile settings (status, visibility) with a dedicated endpoint\n\nA consultant keeps several role profiles, each backed by a resume. Status\n(ACTIVE/PAUSED) and visibility (PUBLIC/PARTNERS/PRIVATE) need a home that the\nbuilder does not overwrite, so they get their own nullable JSONB column\ninstead of builderMetadata (rewritten on every builder save).\n\n- Resume.profileSettings Json? plus additive migration\n- PATCH /resume/:id/profile-settings, owner only, merges what is sent\n- Raw update so it never moves updatedAt (an open builder would otherwise\n  fail its next save as stale), the same approach as linkDocument\n- Tests for the merge, the no-updatedAt rule, ownership and the DTO\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-27T14:01:33-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/1d600745719a94eb832116af3630da3cfcaabd19","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-27T14:01:33-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-27T14:01:33-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["prisma/migrations/20261127120000_resume_profile_settings/migration.sql"],"removed":[],"modified":["prisma/schema.prisma","src/resume/dto/create-resume.dto.spec.ts","src/resume/dto/create-resume.dto.ts","src/resume/resume-crud.controller.ts","src/resume/resume.service.spec.ts","src/resume/resume.service.ts"]},{"id":"7402a42c67285fba1213fd6e1222efc71c59b5ea","tree_id":"5982dc551a9e9d7416e08d2355a7e2a140612953","distinct":true,"message":"Add partnership requests: consultant asks a recruiter to market chosen role profiles\n\n- PartnershipRequest model + migration; consultant_assignments.sharedResumeIds\n- /partnerships: recruiter search, send/list/cancel requests, active partners with per-partner results,\n  change shared profiles; recruiter inbox and accept/decline (accepting creates the assignment)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-27T15:22:52-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/7402a42c67285fba1213fd6e1222efc71c59b5ea","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-27T15:22:52-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-27T15:22:52-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["prisma/migrations/20261127140000_partnership_requests/migration.sql","src/bench/partnership.controller.ts","src/bench/partnership.dto.ts","src/bench/partnership.service.spec.ts","src/bench/partnership.service.ts"],"removed":[],"modified":["prisma/schema.prisma","src/bench/bench.module.ts"]},{"id":"20c12276a442c2f99cc00605f0557a22fb57413b","tree_id":"d3e592219c3f61b81deec4899324c4d998db5238","distinct":true,"message":"Add consultant pipeline: GET /consultant/pipeline\n\nPartner submissions and self-applied jobs for the signed-in consultant: counts per stage, new this week,\nthe latest movements, and results per resume traced through the submission's resume file.\nConsultant role only; commission and vendor fields are never selected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-27T15:38:12-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/20c12276a442c2f99cc00605f0557a22fb57413b","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-27T15:38:12-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-27T15:38:12-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["src/bench/consultant-pipeline.controller.ts","src/bench/consultant-pipeline.service.spec.ts","src/bench/consultant-pipeline.service.ts"],"removed":[],"modified":["src/bench/bench.module.ts"]},{"id":"5c642088b6342e9cd027c921ed47dd4035a336eb","tree_id":"ac8b97a49a5404dfca0ff25a2b642f480ab3c461","distinct":true,"message":"Add blocked duplicate submissions to the consultant pipeline response\n\nAlerts come from DuplicateSubmissionLog for the signed-in consultant (last 90 days, newest 10). A partner repeating a\nsubmission is a duplicate; a recruiter outside the consultant's partners is a conflict. Only the consultant's own\npartners are named.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-28T05:25:22-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/5c642088b6342e9cd027c921ed47dd4035a336eb","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T05:25:22-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T05:25:22-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":[],"removed":[],"modified":["src/bench/consultant-pipeline.service.spec.ts","src/bench/consultant-pipeline.service.ts"]},{"id":"5884c80cfdc16fb2b41c7e8d2c10518b9f92e96d","tree_id":"b55ec4aeb3d831fea102a4d657a0d4002b32e391","distinct":true,"message":"Add consultant report endpoint and editable partnership terms\n\nGET /consultant/pipeline/report returns the funnel for the last N days (optionally ending on a given day) against the\nperiod before, split into own applications and partner submissions, with a row per partner.\nPATCH /partnerships/:id/terms lets the consultant change a partner's privacy level and exclusivity.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-28T05:40:07-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/5884c80cfdc16fb2b41c7e8d2c10518b9f92e96d","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T05:40:07-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T05:40:07-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":[],"removed":[],"modified":["src/bench/consultant-pipeline.controller.ts","src/bench/consultant-pipeline.service.spec.ts","src/bench/consultant-pipeline.service.ts","src/bench/partnership.controller.ts","src/bench/partnership.dto.ts","src/bench/partnership.service.spec.ts","src/bench/partnership.service.ts"]},{"id":"b5d9a61d7d6e4a5e4da32b5cb4157c79fbf828cb","tree_id":"d636a430bfe6c10e5bebe81634d82c7437c57fb8","distinct":true,"message":"Let a consultant give resume credits to a marketing partner\n\nCredits given to a partner become a credit lot of source PARTNER_ALLOCATION that the partner spends first, recorded in\nbilling_credit_allocations so the consultant sees who was given what and how much is used. Includes the migration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-28T06:09:45-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/b5d9a61d7d6e4a5e4da32b5cb4157c79fbf828cb","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T06:09:45-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T06:09:45-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["prisma/migrations/20261127130000_credit_partner_allocations/migration.sql","src/billing/credits/credit.service.spec.ts","src/billing/credits/dto/partner-credit.dto.ts","src/billing/credits/partner-credit.controller.ts","src/billing/credits/partner-credit.service.spec.ts","src/billing/credits/partner-credit.service.ts"],"removed":[],"modified":["prisma/schema.prisma","src/billing/billing.module.ts","src/billing/credits/credit-lot-selection.spec.ts","src/billing/credits/credit-lot-selection.ts","src/billing/credits/credit.service.ts","src/resume-intelligence/resume-intelligence.controller.ts"]},{"id":"bb5c63bb054c8e0bb9da6aa191a930fa3da2f875","tree_id":"f56a03d381ed99717841bf7fad2adaaf41312173","distinct":true,"message":"Add marketing settings and the recruiter side of partnerships\n\nMarketing settings: one row per consultant (GET/PUT /marketing-settings). The partner limits are enforced when a request\nis sent and when a recruiter accepts it, and a submission to a blacklisted company is refused.\nRecruiter side: GET /partnerships/consultants (the consultants they market, with results), /partnerships/duplicates\n(blocked duplicates involving them). Both sides share one results query. Includes the migration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-28T06:10:15-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/bb5c63bb054c8e0bb9da6aa191a930fa3da2f875","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T06:10:15-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T06:10:15-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["prisma/migrations/20261128100000_consultant_marketing_settings/migration.sql","src/bench/marketing-settings.controller.ts","src/bench/marketing-settings.dto.ts","src/bench/marketing-settings.service.spec.ts","src/bench/marketing-settings.service.ts"],"removed":[],"modified":["prisma/schema.prisma","src/bench/bench.module.ts","src/bench/partnership.controller.ts","src/bench/partnership.service.spec.ts","src/bench/partnership.service.ts","src/bench/submission.service.ts"]},{"id":"0616c0953aa2aca3d1c0f0692d9f37b4e70fdb3c","tree_id":"cc9578f7085ede82741225835b942eabcbdbbfa5","distinct":true,"message":"Add the bench-sales Overview endpoint\n\nGET /bench/overview returns the recruiter's own tiles, action queue (offers, interviews, quiet submissions), consultant\nroster with results, and the latest movements with the vendor named. Bench-sales only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-28T07:09:58-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/0616c0953aa2aca3d1c0f0692d9f37b4e70fdb3c","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T07:09:58-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T07:09:58-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["src/bench/bench-overview.controller.ts","src/bench/bench-overview.service.spec.ts","src/bench/bench-overview.service.ts"],"removed":[],"modified":["src/bench/bench.module.ts"]},{"id":"53b3a2a7fb7f0b89ad28bf94a15d08d8e39022d8","tree_id":"23faed72ce8f988427eae2c53139958e512fa272","distinct":true,"message":"Add bench-sales consultant cards and report endpoints\n\nGET /bench/overview/consultants returns one card per active consultant, filtered by the assignment's privacy level and then\nby the consultant's own marketing settings for rate and work authorization; never contact details.\nGET /bench/overview/report returns the recruiter's funnel against the previous period with rows per consultant and vendor.\nThe consultant privacy select is now one shared definition.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-28T07:40:19-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/53b3a2a7fb7f0b89ad28bf94a15d08d8e39022d8","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T07:40:19-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T07:40:19-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":[],"removed":[],"modified":["src/bench/bench-overview.controller.ts","src/bench/bench-overview.service.spec.ts","src/bench/bench-overview.service.ts","src/bench/consultant-pipeline.service.ts","src/bench/marketing-settings.service.ts","src/bench/privacy-filter.service.ts"]},{"id":"fecb57c12ac8ea225bec215028b815a27cdba3d3","tree_id":"ca2eaebc09d68b3f7b757833692e9fae2de3d7b2","distinct":true,"message":"Add recruiter affiliation, submit-to-job, daily report and employer introductions\n\nAffiliation: a recruiter's company, verified by a one-time code emailed to an address at the company's domain (personal\nproviders refused); other people see the company and a verified flag, never the email. Partner search and partnerships\ncarry it.\nSubmit flow: options (resumes the consultant agreed to send, vendors, approval needed) and a submit that records the\nconsultant's approval; vendors can be added in one step.\nDaily report: GET /bench/overview/daily for the daily status call.\nIntroductions: employers can introduce a consultant they manage; the recruiter's inbox shows who introduced whom and\naccepting makes a company-assigned assignment. Includes migrations.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","timestamp":"2026-11-28T08:07:44-05:00","url":"https://github.com/jobfynder-admin/jobFynder-BE-nestJS/commit/fecb57c12ac8ea225bec215028b815a27cdba3d3","author":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T08:07:44-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"committer":{"name":"Jobfynder","email":"167116843+jobfynder@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-11-28T08:07:44-05:00","username":"jobfynder"},"added":["prisma/migrations/20261128110000_recruiter_affiliations/migration.sql","prisma/migrations/20261128120000_partnership_request_initiator/migration.sql","src/affiliation/affiliation.controller.ts","src/affiliation/affiliation.module.ts","src/affiliation/affiliation.service.spec.ts","src/affiliation/affiliation.service.ts","src/bench/bench-overview.builders.ts","src/bench/bench-submit.controller.ts","src/bench/bench-submit.service.spec.ts","src/bench/bench-submit.service.ts"],"removed":[],"modified":["prisma/schema.prisma","src/app.module.ts","src/bench/bench-overview.controller.ts","src/bench/bench-overview.service.spec.ts","src/bench/bench-overview.service.ts","src/bench/bench.module.ts","src/bench/partnership.controller.ts","src/bench/partnership.dto.ts","src/bench/partnership.service.spec.ts","src/bench/partnership.service.ts"]},{"id":"5b2b5c691ffb06d209904f3cd17959ebc4d9a324","tree_id":"146d8e6f4e18c5329814c7aef72075676359a9bb","distinct":true,"message":"Add bench-sales recruiter settings\n\nGET/PUT /bench/settings: how many days before a submission counts as quiet or a consultant as idle (used by the overvi